<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine peso closes higher for third day.</title>
<headline>Philippine peso closes higher for third day.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------- Feb 26 -------------------------</p>
<p>*Peso average at 26.332 vs dollar from 26.336</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The Philippine peso rose for the third straight day on Wednesday amid strong inflows and little dollar demand from oil companies, dealers said.</p>
<p>It closed at 26.332 against the dollar from 26.339. Volume was higher at $210.10 million from $192.50 million.</p>
<p>The peso reached a day-high of 26.329 to the dollar in early trade before the Central Bank stepped in to limit the peso's strength, traders said.</p>
